sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Surface as CLI/Web/Voice
    participant Runtime as AssistantRuntime
    participant Orch as Orchestrator
    participant Mem as Memory
    participant Router as AgentRouter
    participant Model as LLM backend
    participant Policy as Policy engine
    participant Tool as Tool/connector
    participant Verify as Verification

    User->>Surface: "Open my project and summarize status"
    Surface->>Runtime: Submit one request
    Runtime->>Orch: Shared orchestrator instance
    Orch->>Orch: Check mode, skill, and injection risk
    Orch->>Mem: Load relevant context
    Mem-->>Orch: Facts and recent history
    Orch->>Router: Classify task and choose backend
    Router-->>Orch: Available model profile
    Orch->>Model: Prompt + context + allowed tools
    Model-->>Orch: Text or structured tool proposal
    Orch->>Policy: Is this action allowed?
    alt Safe/read-only action
        Policy-->>Orch: Allow
    else Risky/destructive action
        Policy-->>Orch: Confirm or deny
    end
    Orch->>Tool: Execute approved action
    Tool-->>Orch: Result + evidence
    Orch->>Verify: Check expected outcome
    Verify-->>Orch: Verified / partial / failed
    Orch->>Mem: Save turn, evidence, and lessons
    Orch-->>Surface: Human-readable final response
    Surface-->>User: Show result and status
